        "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14202093/assets/75f62c88d82d57bb43d69db5b62afd0f990b0a148c5d22cb48b2cfefe7f331aa.png)\n\nThe function $f(x)$ is defined and differentiable on $[-6,6].$ It's known that $f(-3)=-\\frac{5\\pi }{2}.$ The graph of ${f}^{′}(x),$ the derivative of $f(x),$ consists of two line segments and a semicircle, as shown above.",
