                       </div> <!-- freeResponseLine --> \n                                    </div> <!-- freeResponse --> \n                                \n\n                                                      \n                        </div>  \n\n                        \n\n                        <div class=\"submitButtonFrame\">                     \n                            <div id=\"submitButton-2\" class=\"submitButton enabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div>                            \n                        </div>  \n                  \n                        <div class=\"spinnerFrame\">\n                            <img id=\"spinner-2\" class=\"spinner\" src=\"/img/spinner.gif\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div id=\"question-131247-explanationFrame\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                               \n                        <div class=\"answer\">\n                <table>\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        <td><img class=\"answerSymbol\" src=\"/img/green-checkmark.png\"></td>\n                        <td class=\"correctAnswerText\">Correct</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table></div><div class=\"explanationHeader\">Explanation</div><div class=\"questionExplanation\"><p>From the fundamental theorem of calculus, we find that</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"34\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 15.592em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\